concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-5e-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5E(3) Serious contraventions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-5e-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) To avoid doubt, a reference in this section to a number of penalty units in relation to a contravention of a law of a State or a Territory includes a reference to an amount of a fine or pecuniary penalty that is equivalent, under section 4AA of the Crimes Act 1914, to that number of penalty units. 5F  When a communication is passing over a telecommunications system" ;
    skos:definition "(3) To avoid doubt, a reference in this section to a number of penalty units in relation to a contravention of a law of a State or a Territory includes a reference to an amount of a fine or pecuniary penalty that is equivalent, under section 4AA of the Crimes Act 1914, to that number of penalty units. 5F  When a communication is passing over a telecommunications system"@en ;
