    values:originalText "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a communication is accessible to its intended recipient if it:  (a) has been received by the telecommunications service provided to the intended recipient; or  Stored communications  Schedule 1 Principal amendments  Part 1  Telecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006                   7  (b) is under the control of the intended recipient; or  (c) has been delivered to the telecommunications service provided to the intended recipient." ;
    skos:definition "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a communication is accessible to its intended recipient if it:  (a) has been received by the telecommunications service provided to the intended recipient; or  Stored communications  Schedule 1 Principal amendments  Part 1  Telecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006                   7  (b) is under the control of the intended recipient; or  (c) has been delivered to the telecommunications service provided to the intended recipient."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7f1d4856e47879df31249499693187506833948fb69773d612b9bd0b3f9bb6cc" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-5g ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Communication is accessible to its intended recipient if it has been received, stored under control, or delivered. Defines intended recipient of a communication" ;
