concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-10-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10(3) Telecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-10-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(b), access to a stored communication is taken to be under an interception warrant if, and only if, the warrant would have authorised interception of the communication if it were still passing over a telecommunications system." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(b), access to a stored communication is taken to be under an interception warrant if, and only if, the warrant would have authorised interception of the communication if it were still passing over a telecommunications system."@en ;
