concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-111-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "111(3) Form of applications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-111-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The chief officer of an enforcement agency may, in writing, authorise persons (including classes of persons) for the purposes of subsection (2). However, each person must be entitled under section 110 to make applications on the agency’s behalf." ;
