concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-113 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "113 Affidavits to accompany written applications"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-113 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The application must, if it is in writing, be accompanied by an affidavit complying with this section.  (2) The affidavit must set out the facts and other grounds on which the application is based.  (3) Despite subsection (1), a written application may be accompanied by 2 or more affidavits that together set out each matter that, but for this subsection, this section would have required an affidavit accompanying the application to set out." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The application must, if it is in writing, be accompanied by an affidavit complying with this section.  (2) The affidavit must set out the facts and other grounds on which the application is based.  (3) Despite subsection (1), a written application may be accompanied by 2 or more affidavits that together set out each matter that, but for this subsection, this section would have required an affidavit accompanying the application to set out."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cc17e997c274c4ba0fd7ad4003a0674f6bedce1ba40d97a251be7f9147f77ac3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "17"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-113-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-113-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-113-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
