concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-118 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "118 Form and content of stored communications warrants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-118 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A stored communications warrant:  (a) must be in accordance with the prescribed form; and  (b) must be signed by the issuing authority who issues it.  (2) A stored communications warrant may specify conditions or restrictions relating to accessing stored communications under the warrant.  (3) A stored communications warrant must set out short particulars of each serious contravention in relation to which the issuing authority issuing the warrant was satisfied, on the application for the warrant, as mentioned in paragraph 116(1)(d)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A stored communications warrant:  (a) must be in accordance with the prescribed form; and  (b) must be signed by the issuing authority who issues it.  (2) A stored communications warrant may specify conditions or restrictions relating to accessing stored communications under the warrant.  (3) A stored communications warrant must set out short particulars of each serious contravention in relation to which the issuing authority issuing the warrant was satisfied, on the application for the warrant, as mentioned in paragraph 116(1)(d)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6937fff5d8ce35e1cc7471a05c3d89b985945b9185908a4e01107fb44b0a73d7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-118-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-118-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-118-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
