concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-124 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "124 Access to additional telecommunications services under stored"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-124 ;
    values:originalText "communications warrants  (1) If:  (a) the Managing Director of a carrier has been informed, under section 121, of the issue of a stored communications warrant; and  (b) it is proposed, under the warrant, to access stored communications that, immediately before they became stored communications, had passed over a telecommunications service operated by a carrier; and  Schedule 1  Stored communications" ;
    skos:definition "communications warrants  (1) If:  (a) the Managing Director of a carrier has been informed, under section 121, of the issue of a stored communications warrant; and  (b) it is proposed, under the warrant, to access stored communications that, immediately before they became stored communications, had passed over a telecommunications service operated by a carrier; and  Schedule 1  Stored communications"@en ;
