    cof:title "127(1) Exercise of authority conferred by warrant" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The authority conferred by a stored communications warrant must not be exercised by a person who is not an officer or staff member of an enforcement agency in relation to whom an approval under subsection (2) is in force in relation to the warrant.  Stored communications  Schedule 1 Principal amendments  Part 1  Telecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006                   21" ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-127-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "127(2) Exercise of authority conferred by warrant"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-127-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The chief officer of an agency, or an officer of an agency in relation to whom an appointment under subsection (3) is in force, may approve any of the following to exercise the authority conferred by warrants, or classes of warrants, issued to the agency:  (a) officers or staff members of the agency;  (b) classes of officers or staff members of the agency;  (c) officers or staff members of another enforcement agency;  (d) classes of officers or staff members of another enforcement agency." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The chief officer of an agency, or an officer of an agency in relation to whom an appointment under subsection (3) is in force, may approve any of the following to exercise the authority conferred by warrants, or classes of warrants, issued to the agency:  (a) officers or staff members of the agency;  (b) classes of officers or staff members of the agency;  (c) officers or staff members of another enforcement agency;  (d) classes of officers or staff members of another enforcement agency."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8c22c625f1a213fa35771581b828991f11fc7ff049a6ce39e6481ed736f11b46" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-127 ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Agency may approve exercise of authority by officers/staff members of agency or other agencies." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
