concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-134 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "134 Dealing in stored communications warrant information for the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-134 ;
    values:originalText "purposes of Part 3-2, 3-3, 3-5 or 3-6  A person may, for the purposes of Part 3-2, 3-3, 3-5 or 3-6:  (a) communicate stored communications warrant information to another person; or  (b) make use of stored communications warrant information; or  (c) make a record of stored communications warrant information; or  (d) give stored communications warrant information in evidence in a proceeding." ;
    skos:definition "purposes of Part 3-2, 3-3, 3-5 or 3-6  A person may, for the purposes of Part 3-2, 3-3, 3-5 or 3-6:  (a) communicate stored communications warrant information to another person; or  (b) make use of stored communications warrant information; or  (c) make a record of stored communications warrant information; or  (d) give stored communications warrant information in evidence in a proceeding."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "209ffba61368334c5e8ba422d62ad440763a6659144be39142e39c89daf81ab6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Permits communication, use, recording, and evidence of stored communications warrant information." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf> ;
