doc:sch-1-sec-162-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "162(1) Report to set out how many applications made and warrants" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The report must set out, for each enforcement agency:  (a) the relevant statistics about applications for stored communications warrants that the agency made during that year; and  (b) the relevant statistics about telephone applications for stored communications warrants that the agency made during that year." ;
    cof:pageNumber "43"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-162-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "162(2) Report to set out how many applications made and warrants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-162-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The report must set out:  (a) the relevant statistics about applications for stored communications warrants that were made during that year; and  (b) the relevant statistics about telephone applications for stored communications warrants that were made during that year; and  (c) the relevant statistics about renewal applications made during that year; and  (d) how many stored communications warrants issued on applications made during that year specified conditions or restrictions relating to access to stored communications under the warrants." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The report must set out:  (a) the relevant statistics about applications for stored communications warrants that were made during that year; and  (b) the relevant statistics about telephone applications for stored communications warrants that were made during that year; and  (c) the relevant statistics about renewal applications made during that year; and  (d) how many stored communications warrants issued on applications made during that year specified conditions or restrictions relating to access to stored communications under the warrants."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "701268ef8dffdd93b3b8a11f7b2fca5278f4228d23816e369d13a958cf10ee00" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-162 ;
    cof:pageNumber "43"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Report on stored communications warrants applications and statistics" ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
