    skos:prefLabel "32 Subsection 5(1) (at the end of the definition of certifying"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-32-2 ;
    values:originalText "officer) Add:  ; or (j) in the case of any other agency:  (i) the chief executive officer or an acting chief executive officer of the agency; or  (ii) an officer of the agency (by whatever name called) who holds, or is acting in, an office or position in the agency which is involved in the management of the agency and which has been nominated in writing by the chief executive officer for the purposes of this subparagraph.  Schedule 1  Stored communications" ;
