    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Act, a telecommunications device may be identified by:  Equipment-based interception  Schedule 3  Telecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006                   69  (a) a unique telecommunications number assigned to it from time to time; or  (b) any other unique identifying factor." ;
