concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-4-sec-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Subsection 7(9)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (9) The doing of an act mentioned in subparagraph (4)(b)(ii) or (iii) or (5)(b)(ii) or (iii) in a particular case is taken to constitute a serious offence, even if it would not constitute a serious offence apart from this subsection. Note: See subsection (6). A Part 2-5 warrant can only be issued for the purposes of an investigation relating to the commission of a serious offence." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (9) The doing of an act mentioned in subparagraph (4)(b)(ii) or (iii) or (5)(b)(ii) or (iii) in a particular case is taken to constitute a serious offence, even if it would not constitute a serious offence apart from this subsection. Note: See subsection (6). A Part 2-5 warrant can only be issued for the purposes of an investigation relating to the commission of a serious offence."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "71300dca699a918e0f06bb9c6f7a69bdf50ab5451f969082195833cce8627380" ;
    cof:pageNumber "82"^^xsd:integer ;
