doc:sch-4-sec-33 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "33 Warrants under sections 46, 46A and 48 unaffected" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendments of sections 46, 46A and 48 of the Telecommunications (Interception) Act 1979 made by this Schedule do not affect the validity of warrants issued under those sections before the commencement of this Schedule.  Class 1 and class 2 offences  Schedule 4 Transitional provisions  Part 2  Telecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006                   81" ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-4-sec-34 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "34 Renewals of warrants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-34 ;
    values:originalText "To avoid doubt, a warrant issued after the commencement of this Schedule under section 46 or 46A of the Telecommunications (Interception) Act 1979 may be, for the purposes of that Act, a renewal of a warrant issued before that commencement under section 45 or 45A of that Act.  Schedule 5  Transfer of functions" ;
    skos:definition "To avoid doubt, a warrant issued after the commencement of this Schedule under section 46 or 46A of the Telecommunications (Interception) Act 1979 may be, for the purposes of that Act, a renewal of a warrant issued before that commencement under section 45 or 45A of that Act.  Schedule 5  Transfer of functions"@en ;
